<title>LUXEMBOURG: LUXEMBOURG GOLD FIXING - NATIONAL DAY HOLIDAY.</title>
<headline>LUXEMBOURG GOLD FIXING - NATIONAL DAY HOLIDAY.</headline>
<text>
<p>There is no Luxembourg gold fixing on Monday because of celebrations to mark Luxembourg's National Day.</p>
<p>On June 20 the standard bar was fixed at 339.70 dlrs per oz and a one kilo ingot was fixed at 389,000 Lux francs.</p>
</text>
